<section class="mi9-app-header centerx"> 	  
	  <div class="description-box-info">
	   <h2>Official description</h2> 
	      <div id="description-wrapper" class="description-wrapper">
        <div id="description-content" class="description-content" data-nosnippet>	 
            Brawlify for Brawl Stars! Check which maps and game modes are going to be active next, get the best brawler recommendations on active maps, and track your trophy progression, account updates, battle logs with endless history and so much more!<br><br><br>Active &amp; Upcoming Events<br>• Win Rate Recommendations<br>• Detailed Stats (Win Rate, Use Rate, Star Player Rate, Average Rank, and more)<br>• Map Previews<br>• Active Maps<br>• Upcoming Maps<br>• Map History<br><br><br>Stats &amp; Progression<br>• Check your Stats<br>• Check your Trophy Graphs<br>• Check your Endless Battle Logs<br>• Check every profile in the Game<br><br>Map Archive<br>• Every map in the game<br>• See when the map was last seen<br>• Check out old and disabled maps<br>• Recommended Brawlers for All Maps<br><br>Leaderboards<br>• Ranks for each country<br>• Check top players &amp; clubs in each country<br>• Check out top players in for each brawler and countries<br><br>This application loads https://brawlify.com as a website and adds a custom navigation bar to make it simpler. There are multiple small improvements to make the browsing simpler on mobile on this app, which also helps maintain the unique mobile-app like feel.<br><br>Brawlify is a content creator project with Supercell, we have our own creator code: Brawlify - if you would like to support us either directly in-game or on the Supercell Store.<br><br>Disclaimer<br>This content is not affiliated with, endorsed, sponsored, or specifically approved by Supercell and Supercell is not responsible for it.<br>For more information see Supercell’s Fan Content Policy at https://www.supercell.com/fan-content-policy			        </div>
		<p class="source-note">Source: Official app description retrieved from <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=pro.starlist.app&hl=en" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer">Google Play</a>. Provided for reference only.</p>	
